# The Chains That Bind Us (Bastok 8-1, mission.bastok.the_chains_that_bind_us) through Port Bastok's Argus's 1001: a
# level 75 Warrior at rank 8 with the ASA, ACP, RoV and SoA logs current (their zone-ins quiet) and the nation's
# missions before it completed. Section 1 (no mission current, a char of the nation; no rank and no completed test,
# kept): the gate guard's own mission list, option 24 (no mission's) begins nothing, option 20 begins the mission with
# the zone's YOU_ACCEPT_THE_MISSION; then, current, the mission's EXTENDED_MISSION_OFFSET + 10.
char zone=PortBastok pos=132,7.5,0 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=1
